9. One correction in the scanner

There's one thing I strongly recommend changing from the earlier scanner.

Don't share one JavaParser instance across parallel parsing.

Your JavaSourceScanner should have:

private List<DtoModel> parseFile(Path file) {

    try {

        ParseResult<CompilationUnit> result =
                new JavaParser().parse(file);

        // rest of implementation...

instead of:

javaParser.parse(file)

This makes the parallel file scanning safer.


